    "summary": "As [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, one of your **PSYKER** models with this ability can pick an enemy unit up to 12\" from it and **[visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility)** to it, then roll a D6:\n\n- for a 1, the **PSYKER**'s unit takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)\n- for a 2+, attacks that target that enemy unit get +1 AP until [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase)",
